不，更确切地说是新世界的觉醒</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>投喂</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="queen-of-the-monsters"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box four"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/queen-of-the-monsters">怪物女王</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/queen-of-the-monsters">外海</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>我们好久不见了，是吧？</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>学习</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="5437"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box five"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5437">SCP-5437</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5437">天降之兽</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>一位神明花费了千年的光阴，梦死在其庙宇内</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>高举</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="critter-profile-cappi"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box six"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/critter-profile-cappi">小动物简介：Cappi！</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/critter-profile-cappi">中场休息</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>“威尔逊先生，我认为我们帮助了某只大怪物。”</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>回归</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="reviviscence"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box seven"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/reviviscence">苏生</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/reviviscence">被放逐者之图书馆</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>许多秘密被藏在图书馆的深处</strong></div> </div>