&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;白衣之下&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 120%; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-man-in-the-white-suit-hub&quot;&gt;中心页&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
